        <section  class="c-section u-bg-white" >


            <div class="o-container o-container--narrow">

                    <div class="o-flex">
                            <div class="o-flex__col o-flex__col--6">



<div class="rte">
    <p class="e-h3">At NCC Group, our Research advances cyber security by discovering vulnerabilities, building open‑source tools, and translating insights into practical guidance for customers and the wider community.</p>
<p>Our projects span vulnerability research and exploitation, network and system security, malware and ransomware analysis/DFIR, applied cryptography, hardware &amp; embedded systems/IoT, and software/AI security – with a track record of publishing reports and tooling that strengthen real‑world cyber resilience.  </p>
<p>For over 25 years, NCC Group researchers have contributed deep technical insight across industry and academia, presenting at global conferences and collaborating with partners worldwide. </p>
</div>                            </div>
